{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04439","headline":"登泽州城北楼讌 · 陈子昂","name":"登泽州城北楼讌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生倦游者，观化久无穷。\n复来登此国，临望与君同。\n坐见秦兵垒，遥闻赵将雄。\n武安君何在，长平事已空。\n且歌玄云曲，御酒舞薰风。\n勿使青衿子，嗟尔白头翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}